5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We need a fair way to handle the bicycle spaces. I think I'll look into the last year's complaint log entries and the account from the neighbouring block's secretary to see how others managed.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I'll take a look at the rain exposure along the parking rows and the morning departures watched from the entrance. It's important to know how the bikes are actually being used.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'll check the building account's two-year ledger and the ward cycle park by the station. I'm curious about the money side of things and what the alternatives are nearby.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,I will examine the treasurer's handover file on cash collections and the trial of the supplier's display frame to understand the practical maintenance involved.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I'll check the sticker register and the daily riders, plus the five years of association minutes! I want to see who's actually using the bikes and if things have always been this way.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Misaki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Does anyone else feel we should consider the physical layout more, or are we satisfied with these choices for now?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I think we've covered the bases, Shizue. We have the money, the history, the physical space, and the neighbors. Let's see what we find first!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,I agree. There is no need to overcomplicate the research phase. Let us proceed with these selections and see what the facts tell us.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"I'm excited to see if the minutes reveal any secrets! I'm good with these choices, so let's get to it!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
